Route data (All Rights Reserved):

- MelloUI_Companion/RoadData.lua and MelloUI_Route/RouteData.lua, as released
  after MelloUI 1.1.0, are not covered by the MIT License above: see
  LICENSE-DATA.

---

Data under the GPL-3.0 (not covered by the MIT License above):

- These generated data files hold data derived from the cmangos classic
  database (https://github.com/cmangos/classic-db), which is released under
  the GNU General Public License version 3. They are distributed under the
  same licence; its text is in LICENSE-GPL-3.0.txt:
    Media/QuestListData.lua
    MelloUI_Companion/QuestObjectiveData.lua
    MelloUI_VoiceOver/NPCVoiceData.lua
    MelloUI_DungeonInfo/DungeonInfoData.lua
  The scripts that generate them, in Tools/, are part of the MIT-licensed
  source above and are the files' preferred form for modification, with the
  public classic-db dump they read. World of Warcraft and its content (names,
  texts, items) are property of Blizzard Entertainment.
- MelloUI_DungeonInfo/DungeonInfoData.lua also holds the boss loot lists of
  DungeonMaster by MalkDev (https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/dungeonmaster,
  GPL-3.0): its hand-curated lists for World of Warcraft: Forever's own
  dungeons and for the classic dungeons Forever changed (the drops whose
  source field is 1).
- MelloUI_DungeonInfo/DungeonInfoData.lua also holds Everloot's rows (each
  instance's 13th and 14th fields: drop rates players collected in World of
  Warcraft: Forever): Data from Everloot (https://everloot.app), CC BY-SA 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/), shared under the same
  licence (CC BY-SA 4.0 material may be included in GPL-3.0 works).

---

Third-party material:

- Media/Textures/VoiceOver: overlay textures from the VoiceOver addon
  (https://github.com/mrthinger/wow-voiceover), released under the Unlicense.
- Media/QuestListData.lua and MelloUI_Companion/QuestObjectiveData.lua also
  draw on wago.tools table exports, the game client's own caches, in-game
  positions and, for Forever's own quests, Wowhead's Forever pages.
- The voice pack (MelloUI_VoiceOverData, distributed separately) merges the
  vanilla lines of the wow-voiceover project (Unlicense) with lines generated
  for World of Warcraft: Forever with ElevenLabs voices.
